    "coq9_growth_dilution_candidate": "{&quot;R385_lower_bound_changed&quot;: false, &quot;alpha_mmol_per_gDW&quot;: 0.0001, &quot;alpha_source&quot;: &quot;User selected 1e-4 mmol/gDW on 2026-10-05; uncalibrated provisional assumption, not a measured physiological value.&quot;, &quot;interpretation&quot;: &quot;Q9 retained in newly formed biomass; not consumption per electron transfer&quot;, &quot;pool_balance&quot;: {&quot;R385&quot;: 1.0, &quot;biomass_C&quot;: -0.0001}, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;candidate_not_physiologically_calibrated_by_this_build&quot;}",
    "tpp_requirement_curation_id": "TPP-REQUIREMENT-20261022",
    "tpp_requirement_status": "user_authorized_biomass_term_and_closure",
    "tpp_requirement_authorization": "2026-10-22 user: Approved: implement the TPP plan as written: --tpp-requirement on top of cf0825b8, TPP in biomass_C at the yeast-GEM value 1.2e-6 mmol/gDW, R1342 closed (not deleted), ThiL BLAST check, KO comparison included. No commit or push.",
    "tpp_requirement_evidence": "yeast-GEM 9.1.1 cofactor pseudoreaction r_4598 consumes s_1475, named TDP (thiamine diphosphate: KEGG C00068, BiGG thmpp, C12H16N4O7P2S), at 1.2e-6 mmol/gDW; https://github.com/SysBioChalmers/yeast-GEM/blob/main/model/yeast-GEM.yml (raw file SHA-256 2ddfaaa73ead41ab243127d1b34fa56db2c86052f6eabcd12bb4eea93947dc17, read 2026-10-22)",
    "tpp_requirement_evidence_tier": "coefficient verified in yeast-GEM 9.1.1 on 2026-10-22; it is an S. cerevisiae value, not measured in Y. lipolytica, and is provisional. That TPP is a required cofactor (pyruvate dehydrogenase, 2-oxoglutarate dehydrogenase, transketolase, pyruvate decarboxylase) is established/uncited. m975 has no formula or cross-reference; its identity as thiamine diphosphate is inferred from its reactions R752 (KEGG R00619), R753 (KEGG R00616) and R933 (thiamine diphosphate transport).",
    "tpp_requirement_rationale": "No reaction drained cytosolic TPP (m975) to a sink: its consumers R753 (to thiamine triphosphate, m976) and R933 (into mitochondria, m1116) end in dead ends. So TPP synthesis and THI80 (R752) carried no flux and a THI80 knockout had no effect. Diluting TPP into new biomass makes its synthesis required, as yeast-GEM does for TDP.",
    "tpp_requirement_previous_state": "biomass_C had no TPP term",
    "heme_iron_biomass_curation_id": "HEME-IRON-BIOMASS-20261022",
    "heme_iron_biomass_status": "user_authorized_biomass_term",
    "heme_iron_biomass_authorization": "2026-10-22 user: Approved: implement plan A as written (heme a 1e-6 + Fe2+ 3.04e-5 in biomass_C via an opt-in flag, baseline cf0825b8, iron cap unchanged, KO comparison included). No commit or push.",
    "heme_iron_biomass_terms": "m1635[C_cy] 1e-06 mmol/gDW; m948[C_cy] 3.04e-05 mmol/gDW",
    "heme_iron_biomass_evidence": "yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4598 cofactor pseudoreaction, heme a [c] s_3714 = -1e-6 mmol/gDW; source table cites Forster2003 | yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4599 ion pseudoreaction, iron(2+) [c] s_0924 = -3.04e-5 mmol/gDW; source table cites DOI 10.22161/ijeab/2.2.2",
    "heme_iron_biomass_evidence_tier": "consensus_model_value",
    "heme_iron_biomass_caveat": "Saccharomyces cerevisiae consensus-model values, not Yarrowia lipolytica measurements",
    "lipoylation_growth_dilution": "LIPOYLATION-MODULE-20261020: alpha 1e-05 mmol/gDW each for lipoyl-H-protein and lipoyl-E2, apo forms returned; user-selected provisional value; no Yarrowia lipolytica measurement found; sensitivity at 1e-6, 1e-5, 1e-4",
    "cofactor_biomass_terms_curation_id": "COFACTOR-BIOMASS-TERMS-20261027",
    "cofactor_biomass_terms_status": "user_authorized_biomass_terms",
    "cofactor_biomass_terms_authorization": "2026-10-27 user: Approved: implement the cofactor biomass-terms plan as written: --cofactor-biomass-terms on top of a1237821 (running after --acyl-acp-chemistry), THF m479, FAD m528, riboflavin m926, NAD m122, NADP m41 and CoA m69 in biomass_C at the yeast-GEM 9.1.1 r_4598 values 6.34e-5, 1e-5, 9.9e-4, 2.65e-3, 5.7e",
    "cofactor_biomass_terms_terms": "m122[C_cy] 0.00265 mmol/gDW; m41[C_cy] 0.00057 mmol/gDW; m479[C_cy] 6.34e-05 mmol/gDW; m528[C_cy] 1e-05 mmol/gDW; m69[C_cy] 0.00019 mmol/gDW; m926[C_cy] 0.00099 mmol/gDW",
    "cofactor_biomass_terms_evidence": "yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4598 cofactor pseudoreaction, NAD [c] s_1198 = -0.00264999992214143 mmol/gDW | yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4598 cofactor pseudoreaction, NADP [c] s_1207 = -0.000569999974686652 mmol/gDW | yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4598 cofactor pseudoreaction, THF [c] s_1487 = -6.34000025456771e-05 mmol/gDW | yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4598 cofactor pseudoreaction, FAD [c] s_0687 = -9.99999974737875e-06 mmol/gDW | yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4598 cofactor pseudoreaction, CoA [c] s_0529 = -0.000190000006114133 mmol/gDW | yeast-GEM v9.1.1 r_4598 cofactor pseudoreaction, riboflavin [c] s_1405 = -0.000989999971352518 mmol/gDW",
